{"about_the_game":"<strong><i>Giggly's Park is a procedural FPS platformer horror game, where the goal is to reach the exit of the level before you get caught.<br>You will face lots of unique playgrounds where the rules vary, unlockable new game modes and fun driven mini-games to survive. </i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/f86cc335912a354462ec9b33ed0dc4f4.poster.avif?t=1760800218\" width=540 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/f86cc335912a354462ec9b33ed0dc4f4.webm?t=1760800218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/f86cc335912a354462ec9b33ed0dc4f4.mp4?t=1760800218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Get inside Giggly's Park! The greatest playground in the world, all full of fun and slides, balloons, cakes and many more surprises.<br>As you thrive in for an enjoyable experience, you can't stop but to think something's following you..  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/aa17e34c93fcbf09c33c17ec26b25257.avif?t=1760800218\" width=640 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/4375f01d88b965727725fcce95a4eb8e.avif?t=1760800218\" width=650 height=362 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can't see him, but he's watching you very closely, you ain't breaking his rules  \u00bfRight?<br>ESCAPE THIS PLACE!</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529160/extras/57e7c600aa0268ee1818cbe35e3c5a5f.avif?t=17